  "description": "Want to go further, faster, and with even more comfort?Then the Escondido 1 is the bike for you. Designed for anyone who values more power, more range, and a particularly low-maintenance riding experience in everyday life or on tours.\nAt the heart of the Escondido 1 is the Bosch Performance Line motor—powerful, quiet, and perfectly tuned for sporty rides or longer commutes. Together with the large 625 Wh battery, it will get you reliably through the day with a range of up to 110 km.\nThanks to the low step-through frame, getting on and off is child's play, even with luggage – whether you're going shopping, to the office or heading out on a multi-day tour.\nBuilt for everyday practicality:The Escondido 1 is equipped with the Atran Velo System luggage rack, offering a smart and flexible solution for carrying gear. Bags, baskets or panniers can be clicked on and off in seconds – no straps, no hassle. Whether it’s daily errands or a weekend adventure, the Atran Velo system ensures secure and stable transport.\nAnd now it gets really smart:The Escondido 1 comes with the maintenance-free Gates belt drive and an Enviolo hub gear with continuously variable transmission. You shift smoothly – when stationary, while riding, uphill or downhill – without noticeable gear changes or chain rattling. Simple, quiet, clean.",
